This repository contains an experimental LIN clone of a GMX V2 scalar kernel.
The upstream algorithm in gmx-io/gmx-synthetics is GPL-2.0-or-later after the
BUSL-1.1 Change Date 2026-08-31. The LIN kernel and C11 oracle in this repo
are original implementations of that algorithm at uint64 scale.
